      "accumulated_user_input": "I want to train for the Knysna Half Marathon on 4 July 2026. I want to run a sub 1 hour 35 min race. It is quite a hilly race, with the last few km down a VERY steep road. There is about 340m of elevation gain. and 570m of elevation loss, mostly at the end, but it is mostly undulating.\n\nI run between 45 and 60km per week. I can run most days, but 4 per week usually, max 5. I have a non-negotiable of doing a hill training session every Tuesday evening with my running group called Must Love Hills. No injuries or limitations. I am trying to imprve my cadence. It is about 160spm currently.\n\n1. 45-60km 2. 4 or 5 days a week. Only once on the weekend. 3. None\n\n1. 45-60km 2. 4 or 5 days a week. Only once on the weekend. 3. None",
